Port 22
AddressFamily inet
HostKey /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PermitRootLogin no
AllowUsers labssh
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication no
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
DisableForwarding yes
AllowAgentForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
LoginGraceTime 0
MaxStartups 4
LogLevel VERBOSE
